~ start
Imagination is the fire that turns ordinary dust into stars and dreams into destiny.
The quiet river where ideas dance, where visions grow wings, and where stories are born.
Our people have always shaped their futures through minds brave enough to wander beyond fear.
This thread carries the wild spark that lets children of Ekonu see worlds that do not yet exist. It teaches us that creativity is as sacred as memory. 
Guard it well — for many paths open to those who dare to dream.
=> END
